  "details": "The new Light probe specular with poorly done lighting (unfortunately very common on Quest) makes Avis look bad with default settings and especially Avis that predate the update glow weirdly and look worse than usual\n\nPlease make this a tic that defaults off in the Shaider\n\nThing that will make Avis look better is Disable Fresnel tic\n\nFresnel should default on in the Shaider (because everything already has it)\n\nFresnel is reflection getting brighter as look at the object at a shallower angle (that yucky edge shine)\n\nThis is coming from a Quest main perspective",
